Read-only GET /api/health for go2rtc v1.9.15 (7c05066), used by the copy mode of app.py.
Per stream: each producer's state and counters, each consumer's format, counters and drops,
and whether the consumer is on loopback. No url, source, remote address or user agent, and any
method but GET gets 405, so it can be allowed on a public listener (unlike /api/streams, which
shows sources and accepts PUT/PATCH/POST). It never waits on a producer that is dialing: that
producer is reported "busy", so a healthcheck cannot time out on a slow camera. Comes with its
own tests (go test -run TestHealth).

